# Mentor help window: the "before you send this" intro shown when the window opens.

cmu-mentor-help-intro-header = Before you send this:

cmu-mentor-help-intro-message =
    • Mentor help is busy - some questions may go unanswered. The #gameplay-help channel on Discord lets anyone chip in, not just mentors, and discussing the current round there is fine as long as it stays help-related.
    • Want to answer instead of ask? Sign up to become a mentor - that comes with the Senior Enlisted Advisor role and special permissions like imaginary friend and mghost.
    • Ask the whole question in your first message - 'any mentors online?' just adds a step.
